sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant P as SelfModifyPage
    participant S as SelfModifyStore
    participant I as SelfModifyService(main)
    participant G as Git
    participant M as modelManager
    participant W as BrowserWindow

    U->>P: 输入自然语言改造需求
    P->>S: run(requirement)
    S->>I: self-modify:get-capabilities
    I-->>S: capabilities (writeEnabled, whitelist)

    rect rgb(240,248,255)
        note over S,M: L0 只读分析阶段
        S->>I: self-modify:list-files / read-file
        I-->>S: 源码内容
    end

    S->>I: self-modify:generate(requirement)
    I->>M: generateResponse(prompt + 源码)
    M-->>I: plan + patch
    I->>I: 白名单校验 + 风险分级
    I-->>S: ChangeSet + estimatedRisk

    S->>I: self-modify:preview-diff(changeSet)
    I->>I: 生成 unified diff
    I-->>S: DiffResult
    P->>P: DiffViewer 展示文件清单+增删行

    U->>P: 确认应用
    P->>S: confirmApply()
    S->>I: self-modify:apply(changeSet)

    rect rgb(255,245,238)
        note over I,G: 写模式安全流程
        I->>G: git add -A && commit (snapshot)
        G-->>I: snapshotHash
        I->>I: 写文件
        alt 写入/校验失败
            I->>G: git checkout <hash> -- files
            I-->>S: { success:false }
        else 成功
            I->>I: 审计日志
            I-->>S: { success:true, snapshotHash }
        end
    end

    alt renderer 改动
        S->>W: webContents.reload()
    else main 改动
        S->>W: app.relaunch() + app.exit(0)
    else 配置/人设改动
        S->>I: 热加载对应模块
    end

    U->>P: 应用失败，选择回退
    P->>S: rollback()
    S->>I: self-modify:rollback(snapshotHash)
    I->>G: git checkout <hash>
    I-->>S: { success:true }
